+solution_construct	declaration	fixed_semantics_rules	proof-path_observation
+Module	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:61	reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:124-127	Submitted Module is not loaded by spec.k; direct closure invocation is substituted.
+ImportFrom("typing",...)	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:43	reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k:35-44	Would be an owise no-op, but is skipped because Module is not loaded.
+FuncDef	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:53-54	reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k:14-16	Would bind a closure, but spec.k manually constructs closureVal instead.
+closure call / parameters	reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:185-188	reference-semantics/semantics/call.k:69-75; reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k:63-66	Used by the entry claim; allocates scope 1 and binds numbers.
+Expr(Str(...))	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:13,52	reference-semantics/semantics/str.k:8-17; reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k:48	Docstring evaluates and is discarded.
+Name lookup	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:12	reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:130-154	Used for numbers, locals, and len.
+Assign(Name,...)	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:41	reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k:9-18	Used for initialization and local state changes.
+Subscript(list,index)	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:22	reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:11-14,27-41	Used for numbers[0], numbers[1], and loop pair access; proof-local line 80 specializes symbolic Float lists.
+Int literal	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:9	reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:194	Used for indices 0 and 1.
+Float values	reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:25; reference-semantics/semantics/float.k:20	reference-semantics/semantics/float.k:21	Input Float values are already Val terms in the entry claim.
