+boundary	classification	affects	dependents	evidence	audit_decision
+Trusted supplied reference-semantics/	Fixed selected semantics	control,state,values,exceptions,allocation	All concrete and proof execution	01-integrity.log proves byte/type/tree identity; 04/05 rebuild logs	Acceptable by SUPPLIED_SEMANTICS authority; used rules mapped in used_construct_map.tsv.
+K v7.1.337 toolchain and builtin Int/Bool/Map/List theories	Toolchain trust	All rewriting and proof results	All claims	04-kompile-runtime.log; 05-kompile-verification.log; 06-kprove-positive.log	Ordinary unavoidable machine-checking trust.
