+closestLowVS and closestHighVS	Program-derived result-bearing opaque symbols	final return and postcondition	entry-point claim	verification.k:185-200; 17-vacuity-proof.log	Illegitimate as symbolic connection: concrete evaluator equations do not establish the program-derived value universally.
