Audit complete.

Verdict: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**

The proof reconstructs to `#Top` and passes non-vacuity, but an unproved priority rule skips the property-bearing loop and directly installs the desired result. The proof also never loads the submitted `solution.mpy` and remains `#Top` after material program/loop mutations.

